<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!--
    Shared RabbitMQ message contracts (/S50/, Leitprinzip "einmalig festgezurrt").
    The normalised telemetry events are defined ONCE here in M2 (story 2.3) and
    referenced unchanged by the producer (gateway) and every downstream consumer
    (M3 persistence, M5 management, M6 realtime) via <ProjectReference> — never rebuilt.

    Deliberately framework-free (no FrameworkReference, no package refs): pure records
    plus BCL-only wire helpers (e.g. Protocol/RunIdCodec, the runId/guid uint16[8] codec
    shared by the gateway decoder and the M5 command encoder) so a consumer's inner layers
    can reference them without pulling in the ASP.NET Core shared framework that the sibling
    RaceTracker.BuildingBlocks needs. JSON serialization lives in the transport adapters, not here.
  -->

</Project>
